    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwan wellikwayo pa Kokat ma i kin likwayo pa Levi, kun ilubo doggolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyeradek o wa i kom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyerabic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic pi tiyo tic ma i kema me rwatte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye tic ma likwayo pa Kokat gibitiyo i kema me rwatte: gibitic i kom jami maleŋ makato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gony doŋ bicako wot, Aron ki awobene bidonyo i kema ka kwanyo boŋo kicika, ci giumo kwede canduk lok me caden, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok gibiumo wiye ki laa dyel, lacen gibiyaro boŋo ma bulu i kom meno, ka doŋ gibirwako talle iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibipeto boŋo ma bulu i kom meja me mugati me aketa i nyim Rwot, ka doŋ gibiketo caani i wiye, ki atabo me odok eceta, ki weer, ki cupa me onyo gityer amata; mugati ma gicano i nyim Rwot jwijwi bene obed i wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen gibiyaro boŋo makwar i wiye, ci meno gibiumo ki laa dyel laumme, ka doŋ gibirwako talle iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok gibikwanyo boŋo ma bulu, ci giumo ki okarmac, kacel ki laputte, ki magacce, ki caanine’ ki atabo moone ducu ma gitiyo kwede ticce; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci gibiboyo en ki jami ticce ducu ki laa dyel laumme, ka doŋ gibipyelo i wi tal latiŋŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibiyaro boŋo ma bulu i kom keno tyer me jabu, ka dok gibiumo kome ki gin ma gikwoyo ki laa dyel, ka doŋ gibirwako talle iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibikwanyo jami tic ducu ma gitiyo kwedgi i kabedo maleŋ, gibiboyogi ducu ki boŋo ma bulu, ka doŋ gibiumogi ki gin ma gikwoyo ki laa dyel, ci gibipyelo i wi tal latingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibijobo buru mac ma i keno me tyer woko, gibiyaro boŋo ma lamar lamar i wiye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka dok gibiketo iye jami tic ducu me keno tyer, ma gitiyo kwede tic i kome, weer lawaŋ mac, gin lacob riŋo, akwaya latokke ki becen, jami tic ducu me keno tyer; ka dok gibiyaro i kome laa dyel laumme, lacen gibirwako talle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Aron ki awobene doŋ gutyeko umo kabedo maleŋ ki jami ma i kabedo maleŋ ducu i kare ma giputo gony, lacen likwayo pa Kokat doŋ gibibino ka tinogi, ento pe gugud kom jami maleŋ ducu, wek pe guto. Magi aye jami me kema me rwatte ma likwayo pa Kokat gibitiŋo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eleajar wod pa Aron aye biloyo moo tara, ki odok eceta ma ŋwece kur, ki gityer me moko kwon me nino ducu, ki moo wir, kun dok loyo kom kema ducu ki lwak jami ducu ma bedo iye, en aye kabedo maleŋ kikome ki jami ticce.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pe iwek doggola ducu me kaka pa jo pa Kokat guto gutum woko ki i kin jo pa Levi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ber itimgi kit mau wek gubed makwo, ma pe guto i kare ma gibino cok ki jami maleŋ makato-ni: Aron ki awobene aye bidonyo ka nyutogi tic pa ŋat acel acel ki yec ma gibitiŋo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento gin pe bidonyo iye ka neno kom jami maleŋ kadi matidi mo, wek pe guto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
